        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Oil Rubbed Bronze 36 Inch Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPerfect for your modern renovation, the 36 Inch Rectangular Door Handle comes in a deliciously rich, powder coat Oil Rubbed Bronze . The Oil Rubbed Bronze 36 Inch Door Handle is great for adding style to almost any door, be it an exterior or interior door in either commercial or residential applications. The Oil Rubbed Bronze 36 Inch Rectangular Door Handle can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted and comes packed with the appropriate mounting hardware. You'll need to purchase 2 pulls if you want back to back mounting. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-RTPULL36-size.gif?v=1704354585\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"36 Inch Rectangle Door Pull dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/oil-rubbed-bronze-48-inch-rectangular-door-handle\"><b>4 Foot Rectangle Oil Rubbed Bronze Door Handle</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the 36\" Rectangle Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Length: 36\" (914 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 24-3/8\" (620 mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-9/16\" (64 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2\" (50 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rectangle Handle Diameter: 1-3/8\" x 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Post Diameter: 1\" Square</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/RTPULL36.pdf?v=1704262372\"><b>DWD-RTPULL36-613 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Oil Rubbed Bronze 36 Inch Rectangular Door Handle",
                "description": "DWD-RTPULL36-613: Perfect for your modern renovation, the 36 Inch Rectangular Door Handle comes in a deliciously rich, powder coat oil rubbed bronze. The oil rubbed bronze 36 Inch Door Handle is great for adding style to almost any door, be it an exterior or interior door in either commercial or residential applications. It can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted and comes packed with the appropriate mounting hardware. You'll need to purchase 2 pulls if you want back to back mounting.",
                "keywords": "DWD-RTPULL36-613 36 inch Rectangular Oil Rubbed Brone Door Pulls, Oil Rubbed Bronze 36 Inch Rectangular Door Handles, dark bronze handles, 36 Rectangle Stainless Door Handles, Oil Rubbed Bronze 3 foot door handles, Oil Rubbed Bronze 3 foot door pulls,"
